POLICY - NO PERSONAL VENDETTAS

Every member carries a history. Betrayed villages, dead clans, old enemies. Leave
them at the door.

1. Organisation time serves the beast plan and nothing else. A private grudge pursued
   on that time is a theft of the organisation's effort.
2. Do not detour a mission to settle a score. Do not endanger a cell, a bounty, or an
   extraction for the sake of one man's history.
3. Grudges within the membership are held, not acted on. You may loathe your partner.
   You will not kill him. A dead ring-bearer is a gap in the sealing circle.
4. The Leader alone decides when a personal matter aligns with organisation interest.
   Until then, it does not exist.

Your past is why you are useful. It is not why you are here. - By order of Pain
